`s 378(17) the reservation of the name entitles the foreign company to be registered by that name` MEANS
    IF `the name has been reserved under this section in respect of the foreign company`
    THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The reservation of a name under this section in respect of a foreign company does not in itself entitle the foreign company to be registered by that name, either originally or upon change of name"
